Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: former Senate President

asr-005751
03:47:36.580 --> 03:47:38.820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Soto is the best

asr-005752
03:47:38.820 --> 03:47:40.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Vice Mayor of Quezon City

asr-005753
03:47:40.780 --> 03:47:42.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ever have, but I think you have a good competition

asr-005754
03:47:42.800 --> 03:47:43.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: now.

asr-005755
03:47:47.520 --> 03:47:48.360
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: You're right.

asr-005756
03:47:49.040 --> 03:47:50.980
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: And by the way, the statement you just said,

asr-005757
03:47:51.520 --> 03:47:52.940
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: we can strike off the first

asr-005758
03:47:52.940 --> 03:47:55.160
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: two lines, but the third line, we can retain it.

asr-005759
03:47:56.360 --> 03:47:57.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, that was just a joke.

asr-005760
03:47:57.860 --> 03:47:59.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I respect all three

asr-005761
03:47:59.380 --> 03:47:59.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: former Senators.

asr-005762
03:47:59.820 --> 03:48:03.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: All three former Mayor, all three, all two former Mayors, and the present Mayor.

asr-005763
03:48:03.440 --> 03:48:08.320
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Even the present one, just for the record, yeah, just as I said, a little levity.

asr-005764
03:48:08.320 --> 03:48:09.520
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: All right, Majority Leader.

asr-005765
03:48:09.520 --> 03:48:10.520
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-005766
03:48:10.520 --> 03:48:15.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. President, may we recognize our distinguished colleague, no other than Senator Risa Hontiveros.

asr-005767
03:48:15.940 --> 03:48:17.940
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Senator Risa Hontiveros, recognized.

asr-005768
03:48:17.940 --> 03:48:27.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-005769
03:48:27.940 --> 03:48:28.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Good evening.

asr-005770
03:48:28.940 --> 03:48:29.660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-005771
03:48:29.660 --> 03:48:31.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Chair JV.

asr-005772
03:48:32.000 --> 03:48:32.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Good evening.

asr-005773
03:48:32.920 --> 03:48:33.700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Good evening.

asr-005774
03:48:34.400 --> 03:48:36.700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Bago ako magtanong, ilang tanong lang.

asr-005775
03:48:37.740 --> 03:48:40.120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kanina narinig ko rin si Sekgo humaching.

asr-005776
03:48:40.700 --> 03:48:43.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ang lamig-lamig po, Mr. President.

asr-005777
03:48:43.600 --> 03:48:48.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ewan ko baka pwedeng pabawasin ng konti yung aircon dito sa session hall.

asr-005778
03:48:49.960 --> 03:48:54.120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, isang manifestasyon muna, Chair JV.

asr-005779
03:48:54.720 --> 03:48:58.660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Nais kong magpasalamat, Mr. President, sa ating butihing chairperson,

asr-005780
03:48:58.660 --> 03:49:11.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Senator JV, para sa pagtuloy ng transparency initiative ng budget process na sinimula ng ating butihing Senate President, Sherwin Gatchalian, noong nakaraang budget.

asr-005781
03:49:12.400 --> 03:49:20.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And this year, this is another step further in the right direction towards transparency and accountability.

asr-005782
03:49:21.100 --> 03:49:22.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Senator Riza.

asr-005783
03:49:22.520 --> 03:49:28.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And I think that's the biggest challenge right now of government as a whole, is bringing back the trust and confidence.

asr-005784
03:49:28.660 --> 03:49:30.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In the budget process.

asr-005785
03:49:31.500 --> 03:49:39.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And hopefully, if we can do that here in the Senate, at least we can help bring back the trust in the whole government.

asr-005786
03:49:39.420 --> 03:49:46.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And especially, hopefully, the confidence from the foreign investors and others, Mr. President.

asr-005787
03:49:47.480 --> 03:49:50.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kasama niyo po kaming lahat dyan, Chair, Mr. President.

asr-005788
03:49:51.640 --> 03:49:55.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: However, we have to ask the hard and necessary questions.

asr-005789
03:49:55.580 --> 03:49:57.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Especially since our economic managers are...

asr-005790
03:49:58.660 --> 03:50:08.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, una po, Mr. President, ngayon ay nahaharap tayo sa economic stagflation.

asr-005791
03:50:09.900 --> 03:50:14.240
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Umagsak na sa 2.1% ang GDP growth ngayong quarter.

asr-005792
03:50:14.880 --> 03:50:17.920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ang pinakamabagal, simula pa noong 2009.

asr-005793
03:50:18.460 --> 03:50:20.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Of course, excluding the pandemic years.

asr-005794
03:50:21.360 --> 03:50:25.300
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Patuloy na tumataas ang presyo ng mga bilihin dahil sa inflation.

asr-005795
03:50:25.300 --> 03:50:28.540
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At tatlong milyong Pilipino ngayon ang walang...

asr-005796
03:50:28.660 --> 03:50:29.420
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ang trabaho.

asr-005797
03:50:30.420 --> 03:50:36.100
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Our budget must respond to this crisis, gaya ng sinasabi nating lahat kanina pa.

asr-005798
03:50:36.900 --> 03:50:39.380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Malinaw na hindi business as usual,

asr-005799
03:50:40.060 --> 03:50:46.160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: hindi ayuda ang magiging kasagutan sa mga structural problems ng ating ekonomiya.

asr-005800
03:50:47.320 --> 03:50:51.460
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, Mr. President, ano pong mga programa sa budget

asr-005801
03:50:51.460 --> 03:50:56.740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ang inaasahang tutugon sa mataas na presyo ng bilihin at pati kuryente?

asr-005802
03:50:58.660 --> 03:51:09.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, it was proposed that the removal of that,

asr-005803
03:51:10.360 --> 03:51:18.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: first of all, on system loss charges intends to alleviate the rising cost of electricity in the Filipino households.

asr-005804
03:51:18.900 --> 03:51:28.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: However, these adjustments will result in an estimated 2 billion revenue loss for the fourth quarter.

asr-005805
03:51:28.660 --> 03:51:30.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of 2026.

asr-005806
03:51:30.600 --> 03:51:34.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, the annual average will be about 10 billion.

asr-005807
03:51:35.260 --> 03:51:41.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yan po yung magiging implication of removing the VAT on system loss.

asr-005808
03:51:42.180 --> 03:51:45.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But the DBCC, according to our economic managers,

asr-005809
03:51:45.460 --> 03:51:53.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they'll be meeting within the few weeks to revisit the medium-term macroeconomic assumptions

asr-005810
03:51:53.360 --> 03:51:57.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and the corresponding fiscal revenue projections, Mr. President.

asr-005811
03:51:58.660 --> 03:52:00.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, gano'n, Mr. President,

asr-005812
03:52:01.640 --> 03:52:06.260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: since magpupulong na rin lang naman sila within a few weeks

asr-005813
03:52:06.260 --> 03:52:12.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para i-review yung MTFF, tama po ba?

asr-005814
03:52:12.960 --> 03:52:13.280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yes?

asr-005815
03:52:14.600 --> 03:52:17.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Bakit hindi to get a head start in that direction?

asr-005816
03:52:18.180 --> 03:52:20.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kasi medium-term nga po yun.

asr-005817
03:52:21.100 --> 03:52:22.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Doon sa immediate,

asr-005818
03:52:23.380 --> 03:52:28.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: mas dagdagan pa o taasan pa yung value,

asr-005819
03:52:28.660 --> 03:52:34.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na mga programa sa annual budget natin para sa susunod na taon.

asr-005820
03:52:35.760 --> 03:52:40.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Meron bang kinocontemplate ang government economic managers, Mr. President,

asr-005821
03:52:40.780 --> 03:52:47.700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: good sponsor, para sa 2027 pa lamang maagapan po yung inflation,

asr-005822
03:52:48.520 --> 03:52:51.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at least sa food at saka sa electricity.

asr-005823
