Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. President, according to our DBM Secretary,

asr-005824
03:53:02.280 --> 03:53:08.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they would like to continue on the momentum that will be gained this fourth quarter

asr-005825
03:53:08.780 --> 03:53:14.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that they are anticipating because all of the projects are now bidded out

asr-005826
03:53:14.160 --> 03:53:19.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and hopefully with the early procurement for 2027,

asr-005827
03:53:19.480 --> 03:53:24.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: they would hope to continue this momentum

asr-005828
03:53:24.720 --> 03:53:28.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and hopefully everything will improve and be fair.

asr-005829
03:53:28.660 --> 03:53:31.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Even in the first quarter.

asr-005830
03:53:31.560 --> 03:53:35.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero next year, again, to reiterate their targets,

asr-005831
