Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and spend about 1.3 trillion in infra-projects

asr-005835
03:53:54.660 --> 03:53:57.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to achieve a

asr-005836
03:53:58.660 --> 03:54:00.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 5.8% growth for next year, Mr. President.

asr-005837
