Senator Risa Hontiveros: with a stretch of our imagination,

asr-005850
03:54:56.900 --> 03:54:57.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ang talagang,

asr-005851
03:54:58.660 --> 03:55:02.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: immediate na reassurance na tinatanong ko po sana ay

asr-005852
