Senator Risa Hontiveros: nakikita ko po sa body language nyo,

asr-005861
03:55:27.720 --> 03:55:28.440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: a good sponsor,

asr-005862
03:55:28.440 --> 03:55:30.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: to that we felt right away,

asr-005863
03:55:30.320 --> 03:55:31.540
